{title: 109 - Marvelous Grace}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #109 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 109}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Marvelous [D7]grace of our [G]lov[D7]ing [G]Lord,
[D]Grace that ex[D7]ceeds our [G]sin and [D7]our [G]guilt!
[G]Yonder on [D7]Calvary's [G]mount [D7]out[Em]poured--
[Am]There where the blood of the [G]Lamb [D7]was [G]spilt.
[G]Grace, grace, [C]God's [G]grace, [D7]Grace that will pardon and [G]cleanse [C]with[G]in;
[G]Grace, grace, [C]God's [G]grace, [Am]Grace that is greater than [G]all [D7]our [G]sin!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[G][D7]Grace, [G]grace, [D7]God's [G]grace,
[D]Grace [D7]that [G]will pardon [D7]and [G]cleanse within
[G][D7]Grace, [G]grace, [D7]God's [Em]grace,
[Am]Grace that [G]is greater [D7]than all [G]our sin!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Sin [D7]and despair, [G]like [D7]the sea [G]waves cold,
[D]Threaten [D7]the [G]soul [D7]with [G]infinite loss;
[G]Grace [D7]that [G]is greater, [D7]yes, [Em]grace untold
[Am]Points [G]to the [D7]Refuge, the [G]mighty Cross.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G][D7]Marvelous, [G]infinite, [D7]matchless [G]grace,
[D]Freely [D7]bestowed [G]on [D7]all [G]who believe!
[G]You [D7]that are [G]longing [D7]to see [Em]His face,
[Am]Will [G]you this [D7]moment His [G]grace receive?
{end_of_verse}
